WEBVTT

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:33.320
"Genes of Destiny"

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.920
Please look after them.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:00.750
Certainly!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.350
Everyone, you gotta eat 
to keep up your strength!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.820
Guys, we gotta eat to 
keep up our strength!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.530
Why are you repeating her?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.350
Huh?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.410
I still can't believe it.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.030
What?

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.540
They were here with us, 
but now they're gone...

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.360
I know...

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.520
Hey!

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:49.550
Uh, um, none of us really 
know what to say...

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.330
I'm the same way.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.140
I'm still trying to cope 
with what happened.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.760
I... can imagine.

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:03.170
But Randy and Patrick 
fulfilled their mission.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.430
Here.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:09.690
It's from Patrick.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:13.190
He was planning on giving this to you.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:15.810
He said it's your favorite.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.570
PREMIUM PICKLED SQUID GUTS

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.480
Tamaki, he knew how you love that stuff.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.050
I-I'm gonna have some!

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.190
Are you okay?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:51.350
Here is some water!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.070
It's good...

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.390
It's super good!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.200
Excuse me!

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.390
Here is the data.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.680
The gate is located in 
the Outer Solar System.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.740
The Wulgaru are using this 
gate to invade Earth.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.770
So if we seize this gate, the 
invasion will come to a halt?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.670
The remaining Wulgaru would be unable

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.220
to survive for long without 
replacement cartridges.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.330
If we could just destroy that gate...

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.390
I wish it would be that simple.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.220
It will be incredibly difficult for us

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.980
to approach the gate 
unnoticed and destroy it.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.170
Isn't it your job to devise plans?

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.590
That will be tough enough,

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.400
but it'll be impossible 
to carry out the plan

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.020
if we don't get all 
of the economic powers

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.370
to consent and offer their support!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.410
We must do this, even 
if it's impossible!

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:58.930
Yes, sir!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.630
We cannot cast aside the 
data that two of the

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.970
Dobermans died to deliver.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:05.390
Very well!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:18.950
Here I am!

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:21.670
You have a grain of rice on your cheek.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.900
Huh? Where? Where?

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.290
Might be because I had some 
more pickled squid guts.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.080
You're going to get a tummy ache.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.170
Hey, Tamaki!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.370
Let's sleep together.

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.720
Just this once.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:37.790
Uh-huh!

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:46.350
Hey-

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.060
Say...

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.340
Yes?

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:55.550
Do you think that just 
maybe Patrick liked me...?

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.820
I never even noticed.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.100
What should I do?

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:08.130
Why don't you act like always, Tamaki?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.760
Like always?

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:14.370
Stay the pickled gut-loving, 
lively yet dense,

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.960
naïve and kind Tamaki...

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:19.640
Kei...

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.080
Thank you...

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:30.310
You know, I can't seem 
to fall asleep myself.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.200
Me, too.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.360
And my tummy hurts!

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.220
What?!

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.680
Here's your water.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.280
You shouldn't gobble it down.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:40.640
I couldn't help it...

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.160
So...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.230
...what are all of you 
doing in my room?!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.530
That doesn't resemble them...

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:52.170
But won't they be immortalized 
if Izuru draws a picture of them?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.660
Izuru?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.560
Izuru?!

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.540
This looks similar to Progeria Syndrome.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:06.100
What does that mean?

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.180
His telomeres are shrinking.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.370
On top of that, there is a decline 
in his cellular regeneration.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.900
It's creating a phenomenon 
similar to premature aging.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.720
He's declining faster than 
when I examined him last.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.140
If this continues, it 
could prove fatal...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.580
It could kill him?!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:25.060
Could piloting an awakened 
AHSMB have caused this?

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.410
The AHSMB awoke...?
What is this about?

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.990
I knew that there could 
be some side effects...

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.480
But I never expected 
something like this.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.070
I want the full story!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.670
Try to get some rest.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:38.450
Okay!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.260
You've been through a lot.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.800
You must be mentally and 
physically exhausted.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:44.850
Yeah...

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.040
Izuru!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.310
Are you all right?

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:48.770
Yep.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:49.600
Here.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:50.580
Thanks.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.240
Maybe you should get some sleep.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.280
But not until after you eat.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.350
I know! I'll go get my special 
pickled squid guts for you!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.080
I'll pass on that!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.960
Then I'll stay here 
until you fall asleep.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.710
I'm going to report to 
the captain right quick.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.250
I'm gonna head on out, okay?

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.840
How's Izuru?

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.330
He's going to sleep now.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.790
Kei said she's gonna 
stay with him for a bit.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:29.840
Got it.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:30.980
Where's Ange?

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.840
Ange is getting reexamined.

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:46.930
Commander Simon, I'd like 
to ask a favor of you.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:47.990
What is it?

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:50.190
I want to know about 
his genetic background.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.350
I'm sure Lt. Commander Suzukaze 
has already told you,

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:57.230
but he is gravely ill.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:00.570
And I cannot find an 
effective treatment.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.140
In order to further his treatment,

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.730
I need to know who his DNA donors were

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:06.750
along with the circumstances 
under which he was born.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:09.080
I will give it some thought.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.680
Thank you.

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.810
Commander Simon, this is Amane.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:13.680
What is it?

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:14.800
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.310
Another one?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.050
Sir?

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.360
No, it's nothing.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.110
Regarding the plan to destroy the gate.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:23.990
I summoned the leaders of the various 
economic powers to a conference.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.230
I would like to ask them to offer 
their unreserved support when we meet.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.660
However, I was only able 
to successfully negotiate

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.360
with the Organization of 
American States beforehand.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.820
And?

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.210
There is something that 
I absolutely must have if

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.450
I am to make this operation succeed.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.800
Commander Simon...

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.290
For those of you here,

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.600
I am most grateful that you could

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.110
make today's conference 
despite the lack of notice.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:57.740
Today, we of the GDF have decided

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:02.800
to launch a full-scale attack 
operation on the Wulgaru.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:06.960
Upon analyzing the information 
that the MJP retrieved,

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.140
we've learned that mankind now

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:14.320
has no choice but to work together 
to carry out this operation.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.870
GDF Chief of Staff for Operations,

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:23.780
Captain Amane, explain the operation.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.300
Yes sir! Thank you for coming today.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.590
I will explain the details 
of the operation at

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:31.460
another time to protect 
their confidentiality.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:34.100
In order to make this operation succeed,

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.880
I request that every economic 
power offer their support.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:39.350
We can't blindly pledge our support...

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:42.220
We are ready to offer our full support.

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:45.930
We can't help when you 
can't disclose any details!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.160
Here is the plan.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:53.580
This gate is what the Wulgaru have 
been using to invade our world.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.600
It is possible for a fleet 
to pass through in formation.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:01.780
Until we destroy this, we cannot 
stop the Wulgaru invasion.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.460
It is the target for our operation.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.240
After retreat upon retreat,

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.670
we have allowed them to 
set foot on Earth's soil.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.350
Fortunately, we were able 
to repel their forces.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:16.210
However, we lack the forces needed 
to protect Earth indefinitely.

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.900
This is not about our beliefs or ideals.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.770
We are fighting for our very survival.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.470
To destroy the gate,

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.230
we must bring all of our forces

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:27.850
together and hit that one target 
with everything we have!

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.020
How likely is that plan to succeed?

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:33.280
If we combine all of our 
forces and that plan fails,

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:35.730
wouldn't that spell 
instant annihilation?

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.260
Now Ange is getting 
reexamined! What gives?!

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:43.210
True, both Izuru and Ange tend to 
get so excited on the battlefield

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:45.090
that they act like completely 
different people.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.500
They must get pretty stressed out...

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:51.310
Asagi! Just who I wanted to see.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:55.540
Red 5's pit crew were hoping 
that you could stand

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.750
in for some test runs.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:59.150
Thank you for helping out.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.020
It's nothing...

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.190
We heard that Izuru was 
still in the hospital...

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.150
Is Izurucchi gonna be okay?

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.510
Yeah, probably.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:08.030
Really? That's great!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.280
We were told that no matter 
what happens to Izuru,

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:11.530
this has to be ready to 
go at a moment's notice.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.560
Sorry, but could you help 
us out with some tests?

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:18.490
Each AHSMB has its pilot's 
DNA programmed into it,

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:20.790
so I doubt I'll be able to pilot Red 5.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.650
You can't activate it, but isn't 
it the same type as your Blue 1?

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.020
We're just going to run some tests,

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:27.570
so all we need you to do is sit in it.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.090
But...

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:30.970
At any rate, you should

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.380
quit your griping and groaning.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.710
Go give it a try.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.100
Come to think of it, I've never 
been inside another AHSMB before...

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.560
We have to get ready for the 
test run, so hang tight.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.230
Uh, okay.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.720
It started up?!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.560
Why?

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:59.450
There is a possibility 
that they won't attack us!

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:01.940
Isn't there some way to 
resolve this peacefully?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.370
Even if it means giving 
up some planets and bases,

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:08.240
wouldn't that be preferable 
over this foolhardy operation?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.890
Peace is not an option.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.410
What makes you so certain?

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.420
I believe you will come to 
understand after you hear her.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:21.500
I present to you the Wulgaru 
defector, Imperial Princess Teoria.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.310
A Wulgaru defector?!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.670
Hey! I never heard about this!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.860
A vessel belonging to one of the 
economic powers in the Pacific Rim

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.770
just so happened to stumble upon her

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.360
royal highness and 
offered her sanctuary.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.280
Why was this kept secret until now?

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.270
To avert unnecessary panic.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.390
Furthermore, her royal highness 
was apprehensive that

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.850
this could end in all-out war.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.230
However, she does not wish 
to see us get slaughtered.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:50.840
Everyone, first I wish to apologize 
for the great calamity my planet,

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.280
which you refer to as, "Wulgaru," 
has brought upon you.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:58.730
My world has attacked a great many 
planets throughout our history.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:01.230
This act, which we call "hunting,"

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:04.290
will not end until we have annihilated 
all life on our target planet.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:08.290
You could say that this is 
both part of our unique

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.340
culture as well as a behavioral trait.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.430
However, I began to question 
and loathe our ways,

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.000
which led me to leave my people.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.270
In an effort to prevent 
your annihilation,

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.330
I have offered Earth my 
assistance throughout the war.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.930
Unfortunately, repelling 
our army has proven to be

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.610
an extremely difficult task.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:27.400
However, if you destroy that gate,

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.350
the invasion will come 
to a complete halt.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:33.030
I believe that is the only 
option left before you.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.970
Is that really a Wulgaru princess?

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:38.500
If she's from the enemy 
side, why is she helping us?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.460
Can we actually believe 
anything she tells us?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:46.430
A heat source located 
above satellite orbit is

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:48.340
quickly approaching GDF Headquarters.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.050
I repeat: A heat source located above

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.470
satellite orbit is quickly 
approaching GDF Headquarters.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.400
Please remain calm!

00:15:57.400 --> 00:16:00.230
The unidentified flying object will 
reach GDF Headquarters in- uh...

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.020
Confirming the identification code!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:03.810
The identification 
code belongs to the...

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:05.330
...MJP!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.880
That's a Wulgaru ship?!

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.300
What's it doing here?!

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.180
What's going on...?

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.380
Commander Simon...?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.200
This is the Imperial Princess 
Teoria of the Wulgaru!

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:46.130
Please forgive my unseemly entrance.

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.870
In order to prove what 
I said to be true,

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.420
I wanted everyone to 
see the Wulgaru unit

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.900
that I used to fly here.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.980
Our technology served 
as the foundation for

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.580
the AHSMB units developed by the MJP.

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:02.160
I will participate in this operation.

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:08.600
If everyone does likewise, I shall 
share my information with you.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.730
I implore you to offer your cooperation.

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:15.590
There! That's it for our tests.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.650
Asagi, thank you.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.210
Uh, it was nothing.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:21.020
We weren't able to get 
everything done...

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.520
What are you up to?

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:24.480
Oh, Boss!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.740
We asked Asagi to help 
with Red 5's tests,

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.650
and then the unit turned on!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:32.090
Huh? How did you activate it?

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:34.530
Uh, well, like I would my own...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.110
What gives?

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:40.240
I wonder if Asagi and 
Izuru share similar DNA.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:41.630
Like siblings?

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:49.210
I see. So that's why Red 5 activated.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:50.960
Of all the unlikely...!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.730
So you didn't know about this?

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:53.560
No...

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.750
Asagi is rather shaken.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.460
You should be the one to 
explain things to him.

00:17:58.190 --> 00:17:59.900
This is classified information!

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:03.900
But don't those two have 
a right to know the truth?

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.620
I take it this is about 
how Red 5 activated.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.920
Yes, ma'am. Commander Simon explained

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:12.500
how our DNA is programmed 
into our AHSMB units.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.320
So each unit can only be activated 
by its designated pilot.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:16.860
But I...

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.910
There was a system recognition error.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.320
Are you telling me the truth?

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.460
Yeah.

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:24.040
I want to know what actually happened!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:26.330
I can't fight feeling as I do right now!

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.010
Very well...

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.520
You know  that the MJP was originally

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.960
an organization dedicated 
entirely to manipulating DNA

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:39.240
to develop humans suited 
for space, right?

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:39.840
Yes...

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:43.320
But then the war with 
the Wulgaru began...

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.860
That's when Imperial Princess 
Teoria defected to Earth.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:47.830
After she fled to Earth,

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.510
the organization was 
transformed into the MJP,

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.700
which was meant to 
cultivate AHSMB pilots.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.610
You know about this, yes?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:59.150
We used DNA brought from Wulgaru 
to create those pilots.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.760
But we needed to use as close to 
pure Wulgaru DNA as possible...

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:06.320
As such, it was decided that

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.120
we would use Imperial 
Princess Teoria's DNA.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:09.960
Is that, uh...?

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:13.670
We used Imperial Princess 
Teoria's DNA on Izuru.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.720
Huh? Then how come I was 
able to activate Red 5?

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:21.430
Your paternal DNA came 
from the same source.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.090
You mean-

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.930
I've said all I can.

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.630
Was it... Commander Simon?

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.250
You knew?!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.720
No, I wouldn't say that.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:43.450
So, in a way, you could say that 
Izuru and I are like brothers.

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:45.130
Is that about right?

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:52.810
Asagi, could you please 
keep this to yourself?

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:07.020
I never should have asked...

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:11.950
Asagi!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:16.190
What is it?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.000
Uh, it's nothing...

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.160
Where's Kei?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.670
She was worried about Tamaki, 
so she went back to her room.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:27.530
Is something wrong?

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.650
It's nothing!

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.260
Are you okay?

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.010
Why don't you get a checkup, Asagi?

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:36.490
Nah, I... just have an ulcer.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:39.100
You're acting kind of weird, Asagi.

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:40.360
No, not really.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.100
I know!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:42.900
Huh?

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:44.640
I bet you've got a crush 
on someone, right?

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.300
Wh-where'd that come from?

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:47.920
You just mentioned Kei...

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.920
And then with talk about Patrick, too.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:53.230
Kei? No, I don't really like anyone...

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:54.520
You do!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:56.560
Moron! I just said that's not the deal!

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.990
Okay, got it.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.240
Seriously. It's really 
not like that, honest.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.530
If we...

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.340
If we have something 
we want tell someone,

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.590
we really should tell 
them, shouldn't we?

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.410
While we still can.

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:21.410
Izuru, I want to tell you something.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.850
I think you should know about this.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.220
Asagi, don't tell me you...!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.050
Izuru, you already knew?

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.140
Don't tell me...

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:29.970
...you like me?

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:31.090
HELL NO!

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:33.660
Sorry, but... But I...

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.710
Listen up!

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:37.550
The two of us share the same DNA!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.320
In a way, we're brothers.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.520
We're brothers?

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.780
You and I...

00:21:57.890 --> 00:21:58.960
Big Brother!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.360
I appreciate your cooperation 
in this operation.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:08.140
Captain Amane will be the 
commanding officer presiding

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:10.250
over the operation to destroy the gate.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:56.040
"Night before the Decisive Battle"
